# R87: a written fraction stored in a vitti is refused (E_DASHAM_VITTI). R92 (v281): a computed
# dasham stored in a vitti must be a whole number - 2.0 converts to 2; 2.75 would stop the
# program with E_DASHAM_VITTI (up to v280 it truncated toward zero, silently).
mukhya() {
    dasham x = 2.0
    vitti a = x
    vitti b = 0.0 - x
    dasham c = 2 + 0.5
    likha(a)
    likha(b)
    likha(c)
}
